---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="404 | Page not found (probably stepped on)">
	<main class="mx-auto max-w-xl px-6 py-8 text-center font-sans">
		<h1 class="m-0 mb-2 text-5xl leading-[1.1] tracking-[0.02em] text-gray-900">4 0 4</h1>
		<p class="m-0 mb-4 text-lg leading-[1.7] text-gray-900">
			Well, this isn't great. We searched every brick, every stud, and even under the
			rug — this page doesn't exist.
		</p>
		<ul class="mb-6 list-disc pl-5 text-left text-[15px] leading-[1.7] text-gray-700">
			<li>You lost the instruction booklet (it's always the last step).</li>
			<li>Someone stepped on this URL and it's now in excruciating pain.</li>
			<li>The page went for a swim in the brick bin, never to be found again.</li>
			<li>You simply snapped it apart with one of those little red plastic separators.</li>
		</ul>
		<p>
			<a
				href="/"
				class="mt-3 inline-block rounded bg-[#e3000b] px-5 py-2.5 font-semibold text-white no-underline shadow-[0_4px_0_#9a0007] transition-[transform,box-shadow] duration-[0.05s] ease-linear hover:translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-[0_2px_0_#9a0007] active:translate-y-1 active:shadow-none"
				>Build your way back home</a
			>
		</p>
	</main>
</Layout>
